        "created_at": "2014-03-08T13:30:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No complaints at all. It's good clean fun for a level one hero. My questions were simply has everyone seen how her cards interact to create chains, and does it feel like anyone else like a console fighter game.</p>",
