        "id": 95201,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-08T16:36:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I didn't get the console fighter feel from her, but I did get a solid feel for her 'chains' of play in the few times that I've played her. &nbsp;For the Greater Good and Battlefield Experience combine beautifully, particularly if your Conduit Blade and Servo Gauntlet are already in play. &nbsp;</p><p>I find that KNYFE may be my favorite of the Vengeance heroes, actually. &nbsp;She takes a bit of forethought to build up chains of attacks, giving her a touch more complexity than, say, Ra or Haka. &nbsp;But, she's effective straight out of the gate and really only gets stronger the more she has in play. &nbsp;Plus, her ability to kill a target&nbsp;<em>and</em> and ongoing in one shot is pretty awesome.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:21:58.209Z",
