        "created_at": "2014-03-08T21:30:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The highest someone in my group got with Knyfe's damage was 50 in one turn, without any outside buffs. Think he&nbsp;played all copies&nbsp;of For the Greater Good and Battlefield Experience, plus had her own damage buffs for melee and energy. This was on Mars fighting Plague Rat, so we had a Metoer Storm to delay and build up.</p>",
