        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/f0a364/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-10T18:48:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I remember we ran into a game with Knyfe, the Sentinels and Naturalist, where Knyfe ended up with her hand in her deck and at full health and we decided to see how much damage she could put out in a single turn.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If I remember right, she got a number higher than Unity's single turn damage (the previous no-outside-intereference record). She punched herself a lot too, but that we didn't count that.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-i\">She can hurt people good.</span></p>",
        "post_number": 9,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:21:58.592Z",
